 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(N \log N)$ due to sorting for percentile calculation, where $N$ is the number of finite voxels. The mapping pass is $O(N)$.
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ to store finite values for percentile calculation.
-- **Performance:** Efficient for pre-computed visualization. The gamma operation is a single power function per voxel.
-- **Strengths:** Robust against outliers due to percentile thresholding; enhances visibility of low-intensity structures via gamma compression.
-- **Limitations:** Requires a full pass over the data to compute percentiles; not suitable for streaming data without approximation.
